        "id": "ch13_6-1",
        "text": "Exercises\n1.\nWhat type of modules have compatibility information?\n2.\nWhy might a module have no compatibility information?\n3.\nWe\u2019ve run Get-PSSession , and we can see that there is a remote session called\nWinPSCompatSession running on the localhost machine. What version of PowerShell\nis it running?\n4.\nWhat sort of objects do we get back from commands run in the WinPSCompatSession ?\n5.\nOur local admin has disabled implicit Windows compatibility on our machine. How can we\nstill import modules in Compatibility mode?\n6.\nWhat CIM class contains instances of namespaces?\n7.\nWhat is the purpose of the -OperationTimeoutSecs parameter on the\nGet-CimInstance cmdlet?\n8.\nWhat cmdlet would we use to change the properties of a WMI object?\n9.\nHow do we pass method parameters to Invoke-CimMethod and what format do they need\nto be in?",
